MEASURED OFFLINE** could not be evaluated against the provider that produced
it -- the reason is given in that section, and no number is printed in its
place. Provenance (provider, and model per agent role) is a field on every
row below, read back from the `ModelCall` audit trail for exactly the runs
that produced that row -- not one blanket value for the whole report, since
a mixed run can back different checks with different providers or models.

